      "text": {
        "jp": "えぇ、この先の玉座の間まで来ていました。\r\n大勢の兵士が足止めを……。",
        "official_en": "Yes, he broke through to the throne room. A whole company of soldiers tried to hold him back there...",
        "real_en": "Yes, he made it as far as the throne room up ahead. A great many soldiers were trying to hold him off..."
