      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "待て、ここに来るまで手傷も負っている。\r\n一度この部屋で態勢を整えよう。",
        "official_en": "Wait, we’ve sustained a few injuries ourselves. It would be wise to tend to them briefly here.",
        "real_en": "Wait. We've been wounded on the way here. Let's regroup in this room first."
      },
