      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "確実に助け出すためさ。\r\nモタモタするつもりはない。",
        "official_en": "We need to even the odds as best we can. Don’t worry, we won’t need long.",
        "real_en": "So we can be sure we save him. We won't waste any time."
